{'symbol': 'TFC', 'date': '2021-10-26 14:19:00', 'title': 'TRUIST DECLARES COMMON AND PREFERRED STOCK DIVIDENDS', 'text': 'CHARLOTTE, N.C., OCT. 26, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF TRUIST FINANCIAL CORPORATION (NYSE: TFC) DECLARED A REGULAR QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND OF $0.48 PER COMMON SHARE, PAYABLE ON DEC. 1, 2021, TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AT THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON NOV. 12, 2021.'}